< q3
A time came from a form as text: `raw = "75.3"`. Convert it to a float, then split it into whole minutes and leftover seconds, and print `1:15.30`.
< h3
`float(raw)`, then `//` (whole-number division) and `%` (remainder).
< a3
raw = "75.3"
seconds = float(raw)          # "75.3" is text; float() turns it into a number
minutes = int(seconds // 60)  # how many full minutes fit: 1
rest = seconds % 60           # what is left over: 15.3
print(f"{minutes}:{rest:.2f}")

